{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39837","headline":"中秋自宛陵寄池阳太守 · 殷文圭","name":"中秋自宛陵寄池阳太守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出山三见月如眉，蝶梦终宵遶戟枝。\n旅客思归鸿去日，贤侯行化子来时。\n郡楼遐想刘琨啸，相合方窥谢傅棊。\n按部况闻秋稼熟，马前迎拜羡幷儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39837.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39837","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}